OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigation after county
OL,4,Asigns taken
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter road signs marking the boundary
OL,8,Fof Rutland were removed without
OL,9,Fpermission.
OL,11,FRutland County Council said following a
OL,12,Fseries of checks and a full audit it
OL,13,Fdiscovered 10 signs had been taken -
OL,14,Fprompting the authority to take down 17
OL,15,Fas a precaution.
OL,17,FAccording to the council, the signs
OL,18,Fwould remain in storage while officials
OL,19,F"assess options for their replacement
OL,20,For reinstatement".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
