OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigation after county
OL,4,Asigns taken
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,Fsaid the council was first made aware
OL,8,Fof the missing signs in late July,
OL,9,Fafter their absence was noted on roads
OL,10,Ffrom Braunston to Knossington,
OL,11,FBraunston to Withcote and Knossington
OL,12,Fto Oakham.
